    "\ciDun Dunnnnn!. \cjYou are \ciGuts Buddy\cj, help people! \n\ckThrow a rock! \n\cdOr punch people! \n\cnOr even cause a quake!",
    "C", "appears", "GUTS BUDDY WANTS TO SHARE HIS FEELINGS"
  );
  AddBossMusic(46, "M_UB046 6", "A Tough Fight", "River City Ransom (NES)", "Kazuo Sawa", 1, 0);
  DefineBoss(
    47, "RussianGuts", "\cvRussian \ccGutsman",
    UHBOSS_POOL_COMMON,
    3275, 350,
    "",
    "",
    "I come to destroy capitalist land, is nice. \n\ckPick up boulders with primary clicking button, click again to throw them.\n\cdSecondary clicking button punches sad loser, very good.\n\cjMighty communist force of grabbing boulder and then hitting \cdpunch\cj button \nwill allow me to \cdtoss boulder\cj up to sky. \cdPunch\cj tossed boulder to obliterate foes.\nOnce my wrath hits it's boiling point, is time to initiate \cgDeathblow\c- throw.",
    "C", "appears", ""
  );
  AddBossMusic(47, "M_UB047", "Stalmaster Battle", "Skyward Sword", "Takeshi Hama", 1, 0);
  DefineBoss(
    48, "RedeadGuts", "\cqRedead \ccGutsman",
    UHBOSS_POOL_COMMON,
    6850, 345,
    "",
    "",
    "To be replaced by tetrimos is humiliating.\nTo be forgotten is worse than death.\nBut I awaken once more, to get the job done.\nBack at it again \ckthrowing\cj out boulders with my greater arm.\n\cdRam\cj and \cnslam\cj back at the construction sites.\nI might be slow, but I'm \cidetermined\cj to get revenge.",
    "C", "reawakens", ""
  );
  AddBossMusic(48, "M_UB048", "Evening of the Undead", "Zombies Ate My Neighbors", "Joe McDermott", 1, 0);
  AddBossEnrageMusic(48, 0, "M_UB048X", "Boss Battle", "Zombies Ate My Neighbors", "Joe McDermott", 1, 0);
  DefineBoss(
    49, "Troutius", "\ciTroutius",
    UHBOSS_POOL_COMMON,
    2500, 366,
    "",
    "",
    "It's not a phase.\nI \ckshoot\cj, I \cdkick\cj and deny society because I'm Troutius.\nYou don't control my life, I make my own decisions because I am the edge of the night.\nSharp enough, it makes me crawl in my skin.",
    "Ck.", "appears, because yes", ""
  );
  // https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=08uY-Mme6Bs
  AddBossMusic(49, "M_UB049", "Battle! Gladion (MMX Soundfont Cover)", "Pok\xE9mon Sun & Moon", "Bulby", 1, 0);
  DefineBoss(
    50, "HalfPressHardman", "\ckHalfPress \chHardman",
    UHBOSS_POOL_COMMON,
    2460, 412,
    "",
    "",
    "\ckMainfire to give them the ol' one-two combo.\n\cdAltfire for a super press; more air time for more power.\n\cgRage to warp onto a random player.",
