  AddBossMusic(61, "M_UB061", "Dunes Club Doubles Match (Sped-Up)", "Mario Golf: Advanced Tour", "Motoi Sakuraba", 1, 0);
  DefineBoss(
    62, "TorontoCalifornia", "\ccAgent TorCal",
    UHBOSS_POOL_COMMON,
    1500, 250,
    "",
    "",
    "Infiltration success. \nThis isn't fantasy, it's real life. I've no need for a gun when I got my own hand. \nI got the tactical gear to stay out of enemy sight and catch them by surprise. \nBut just how many times can I undo my mistake-- Mistakes? No... \nI'm the best there is.",
    "", "", ""
  );
  AddBossMusic(62, "M_UB062", "Never Return Alive", "Streets of Rage 2", "Yuzo Koshiro", 1, 0);
  DefineBoss(
    63, "PlasmaSpark", "\cdPlasma \cjSpark",
    UHBOSS_POOL_COMMON,
    2150, 300,
    "",
    "",
    "There's never enough energy to burn. At least, I think...? \nI'm able to build up power just by moving around, enough to fire a shocking projectile. The more, the better. \nDon't get too close or it'll be a electrifying revelation to you that I can fry you! \nI'm not a villain or anything, I'm just on my way to work... at Walmart.",
