    "",
    "Congratulations, you have purchased some fancy horse armor. But it was sold out so here's a centaur instead.\n\ckMainfire fires a spread of arrows, or an explosive arrow if you have full power.\n\cnUse your item to enter another dimension and press \ckMain \cnto fire a trick shot or \cdAlt\cn to return to reality with a boom.\n\cjWith full \cgrage\cj, Press \cdAlt\cj to stop time. Press \ckMain\cj to fire arrows or \cdAlt\cj to place bombs- these will trigger when time returns to normal.",
